<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How pprgaming.com handles visitor information, cookies, analytics, advertising and affiliate links."><div class="prose"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><em>Last updated: October 31, 2026.</em></p>
<p>This policy explains how PPRGaming ("we," "us"), at pprgaming.com, handles information about visitors. The site is run by Ron Carter Jr. If you have a question about it, email <a href="mailto:contact@pprgaming.com">contact@pprgaming.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you use the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>, we receive your name, email address and message. The form is delivered by FormSubmit (formsubmit.co), and we use what you send only to read and answer your message.</li>
<li><strong>Analytics.</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand which pages people visit and how they find the site. It collects things like your approximate location, browser and device type, and pages viewed, using cookies. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Hosting.</strong> The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which may log basic technical data such as IP addresses for security and operation. See <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>We don't sell your personal information, and we don't ask for accounts or passwords.</p>
<h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
<p>We use, or may use, Google AdSense to show ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites on the Internet. You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads">Google Ads Settings</a> or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">www.aboutads.info</a>. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p>
<p>Where the law requires it, such as in the EEA, the UK and Switzerland, visitors will be asked for consent before personalized ads are served.</p>
<h2>Affiliate links</h2>
<p>PPRGaming.com is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com. As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. When you click an affiliate link, Amazon may set cookies to track the purchase. See our <a href="/editorial/">Editorial &amp; Corrections policy</a> for how affiliate links fit with our coverage.</p>
<h2>Embedded content</h2>
<p>Some pages embed posts from X (formerly Twitter). Those embeds load from X and may set their own cookies under <a href="https://x.com/en/privacy">X's privacy policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR or the CCPA/CPRA), you may have the right to ask what personal data we hold about you, or to have it corrected or deleted. Email <a href="mailto:contact@pprgaming.com">contact@pprgaming.com</a> and we'll respond.</p>
<h2>Children</h2>
<p>This site is not directed to children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their information.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If this policy changes, we'll update it here and change the date at the top.</p>
</div></Base>
